---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import CourseIndex from '../components/CourseIndex.astro';
import { getLessons, pad, sitePath } from '../lib/lessons';
const lessons = await getLessons();
const range = `${pad(lessons[0].data.lesson)}—${pad(lessons.at(-1)!.data.lesson)}`;
---
<Base>
  <section class="home-hero wrap">
    <div class="hero-main"><p class="eyebrow accent">OVERWATCH 2 / A DIGITAL HANDBOOK</p><h1>守望先锋<br />竞技学宝典<span class="title-dot">.</span></h1><p class="hero-deck">读懂每一次交战，<br class="mobile-break" />建立自己的竞技理解。</p><div class="hero-author"><span class="small-label">WRITTEN BY</span><span>守望先锋竞技学教父</span></div><p class="hero-experience">10,000+ 小时游戏积累<br />五年比赛与观赛经验 · 数百小时复盘指导</p><a class="text-link" href={sitePath('/lessons/01-team-review/')}>开始阅读 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    <div class="editorial-cover" aria-hidden="true"><div class="cover-top"><span>COMPETITIVE<br />STUDIES</span><span>持续更新<br />ONLINE EDITION</span></div><div class="cover-type">读懂交战<span>掌握全局</span></div><div class="cover-rule"></div><div class="cover-index">{lessons.map(({data}) => <span>{pad(data.lesson)} / {data.shortTitle || data.title}</span>)}</div><div class="cover-bottom">READ THE FIGHT. SEE THE GAME. <span>↗</span></div></div>
    <div class="hero-bottom"><span class="eyebrow">READ. UNDERSTAND. APPLY.</span><span>为交战中的判断，建立共同的语言。</span></div>
  </section>
  <section class="index-section wrap" aria-labelledby="course-index"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow accent">COURSE INDEX / {range}</p><h2 id="course-index">课程目录</h2></div><p>按课阅读，也可以从眼前的问题开始。</p></div><CourseIndex /></section>
  <section class="philosophy wrap"><div><p class="eyebrow accent">FROM EXPERIENCE TO A HANDBOOK</p><h2>把多年积累，<br />写成一本教程。</h2></div><div><p>这套教程源于我 10,000+ 小时的游戏积累、五年的比赛与观赛经验，以及数百小时的复盘指导。</p><p>在学习、参考许多优秀教练同僚的思路后，我把这些积累逐步梳理成《守望先锋竞技学宝典》。从课程结构到正文表达，这是我精心制作、持续打磨的一套教程。</p><p>希望这些经验能够帮助你理解交战，在比赛中形成更清楚的判断。</p><a class="text-link" href={sitePath('/about/')}>关于这本手册 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
</Base>
